{"id":"lumie_re","lemma":"lumière","pos":"noun","rank":595,"glosses":["light","lumen"],"ipa":"/ly.mjɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bd/Fr-lumi%C3%A8re.ogg/Fr-lumi%C3%A8re.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"lumières"},"formAudio":{"lumières":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-lumi%C3%A8res.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je peux voir la lumière.","en":"I can see the light.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/75678","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Je vois une lumière.","en":"I see a light.","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"I see, right"]]},{"text":"Que veulent dire ces lumières ?","en":"What do those lights signify?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to say, to tell"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"J'arrive à voir la lumière.","en":"I can see the light.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/45792","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to arrive","l":"arriver"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Puis-je éteindre les lumières ?","en":"May I turn off the lights?","words":[{"g":"then"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to turn off"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]}]}